g, and reporting, Hootsuite works well for teams managing large volumes of conversations and campaigns across multiple networks. It is especially suited for businesses that rely heavily on data, automation, and structured workflows to scale their social media efforts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Key Features of Hootsuite:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Schedule and publish posts across Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, YouTube, X (Twitter), LinkedIn, Threads, Pinterest, WhatsApp, and Bluesky<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Social-first <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI<\/a> assistant for content ideas, captions, scripts, and strategy insights<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Unified inbox for DMs, comments, and mentions with saved replies and automation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Advanced social listening to track keywords, brand mentions, trends, and competitors<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Custom analytics reports, templates, benchmarking, and performance tracking<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Team collaboration with message assignments, approvals, and internal notes<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Built-in Canva templates and stock images for faster content creation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Hootsuite Pricing Plans:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Plan<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Price (per user\/month)<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Best For<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Key Inclusions<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Standard<\/td><td>\u20b91,915<\/td><td>Small teams &amp; businesses<\/td><td>Up to 10 social accounts, unlimited scheduling, AI assistant<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Advanced<\/td><td>\u20b97,540<\/td><td>Growing teams &amp; agencies<\/td><td>Unlimited accounts, custom reports, saved replies, approvals<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Enterprise<\/td><td>Custom<\/td><td>Large enterprises<\/td><td>Custom workflows, SSO, advanced tools, priority support<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Sprout Social<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Sprout Social is a premium social media management software built for brands and teams that treat social media as a core business function, not just a posting channel. It combines publishing, engagement, analytics, listening, and influencer marketing into a single, enterprise-grade platform.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Sprout Social stands out for its depth of insights\u2014helping teams understand audience behavior, brand sentiment, and industry trends in real time. With AI-powered replies, advanced reporting, and strong collaboration features, it enables businesses to deliver consistent customer experiences at scale.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Beyond day-to-day management, Sprout Social also supports creator and influencer campaigns, making it a strong choice for brands focused on growth, reputation, and long-term social strategy rather than basic scheduling alone.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Key Features of Sprout Social:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Content planning and scheduling with collaborative workflows<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Unified smart inbox for messages, comments, and mentions<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>AI-powered response suggestions for faster, empathetic engagement<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Advanced analytics and reporting tied to business goals<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Social listening to discover trends, sentiment, and audience insights<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Influencer and creator campaign management tools<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brand safety checks and performance measurement for campaigns<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Sprout Social Pricing Plans:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Plan<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Price (per seat\/month)<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Best For<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Key Inclusions<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Standard<\/td><td>$199<\/td><td>Small teams<\/td><td>Publishing, engagement, basic analytics<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Professional<\/td><td>$299<\/td><td>Growing teams<\/td><td>Advanced reporting, social listening, higher limits<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Advanced<\/td><td>$399<\/td><td>Large teams &amp; enterprises<\/td><td>Cross-team workflows, deeper insights, premium features<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Zoho Social<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Zoho Social is a well-balanced social media management software designed for businesses that want powerful features without enterprise-level complexity. It focuses on smart scheduling, real-time monitoring, and detailed analytics, making it a strong choice for small to mid-sized brands.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Zoho Social helps teams stay consistent by publishing content at the right time using best-time predictions or custom schedules. Its visual content calendar makes planning campaigns simple, while the monitoring dashboard keeps conversations and mentions easy to track.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With strong reporting tools and smooth integration across major platforms, Zoho Social works especially well for businesses already using the Zoho ecosystem but remains equally useful as a standalone social media management tool.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Key Features of Zoho Social:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Smart scheduling with best-time predictions to maximize engagement<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Visual content calendar for organized and balanced publishing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real-time monitoring dashboard with multiple listening columns<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick engagement with comments, mentions, and messages<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Advanced social analytics with pre-built and custom reports<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Seamless integration with X, Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, TikTok, Pinterest, YouTube, Google Business Profile, and Mastodon<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supports unlimited post scheduling across connected channels<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Zoho Social Pricing Plans:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Plan<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Price (per month, billed annually)<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Best For<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Key Inclusions<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Free<\/td><td>\u20b90<\/td><td>Individuals &amp; beginners<\/td><td>1 brand, up to 6 channels, basic features<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Standard<\/td><td>\u20b9600<\/td><td>Small businesses<\/td><td>1 brand, up to 10 channels, scheduling &amp; analytics<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Professional<\/td><td>\u20b91,725<\/td><td>Growing brands<\/td><td>Advanced analytics, monitoring, higher limits<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Premium<\/td><td>\u20b92,595<\/td><td>Teams &amp; agencies<\/td><td>More channels, team members, expanded reporting<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. HubSpot<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>HubSpot offers a powerful social media management software that is deeply integrated with its CRM and marketing ecosystem. Unlike standalone scheduling tools, HubSpot focuses on relationship-driven social media\u2014helping businesses connect social conversations directly with real contacts, leads, and customers.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>From publishing posts and monitoring mentions to tracking sentiment and measuring ROI, everything happens in one unified system. HubSpot allows marketers to manage conversations from platforms like Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, X (Twitter), and YouTube without switching dashboards.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Its AI-powered social post generator and keyword monitoring make content creation and brand listening faster, while CRM integration ensures every interaction is contextual and measurable. This makes HubSpot especially valuable for businesses that treat social media as a revenue and customer experience channel, not just a visibility tool.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Key Features of HubSpot Social Media Tools:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Publish and schedule posts directly to major social platforms<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>AI-powered social post generator and best-time posting suggestions<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Unified social inbox for comments, mentions, and messages<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keyword monitoring with alerts for brand and prospect mentions<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sentiment analysis and AI-driven social insights<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>CRM-linked conversations for personalized engagement<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Social media ROI tracking with visits, leads, and customers data<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Campaign tagging to measure social impact on overall marketing goals<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Sendible<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Sendible is a feature-rich social media management platform built primarily for agencies, marketing teams, and professionals managing multiple brands or clients. It focuses on structured workflows, automation, and client-facing features like white labeling and automated reports.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Sendible allows users to plan, publish, analyze, and collaborate from one central dashboard, making it easier to manage high-volume social media operations. Its smart scheduling tools, bulk imports, and content libraries help teams stay consistent without repetitive manual work.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>What sets Sendible apart is its strong emphasis on client management\u2014secure onboarding, branded reports, and campaign organization\u2014making it one of the most practical social media management tools for agencies handling multiple accounts at scale.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Key Features of Sendible:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Centralized dashboard for managing multiple brands and platforms<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Smart Compose Box for quick post creation and scheduling<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Priority Inbox to reply to comments and messages from one place<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bulk content import for long-term planning<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Smart queues and optimal-time scheduling for